      "role": "user",
      "content": "stubborn act of being here... i don't know. it just feels like a lot of effort to keep doing the same things every day. walking to the kitchen, checking the mail, sitting in this chair. it's all just a cycle of waiting for the body to finally give up. i'm just tired of the waiting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
