      "content": "break it? i feel like i've already broken. the autonomy is gone. i can't even decide when to sleep or when to eat without my body just failing me or my pills making me groggy. i've lost control of everything. i just wish i could have some kind of say in how this ends, rather than just being a passenger in a car with no brakes.",
